    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5681afef57bac591740da967",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩接连赢得比赛。那个性格自卑、\n自认配不上目白家之名的赛马娘\n已经不是从前的她了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bfaa69b0f641badbd3b240157fa7930c019ee9855f4971172ae922440452f54",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
