    {
      "uid": "zhcn:456c364abbce884d9b089f17",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……现在她为了取胜专注地投入比赛。\n自从看过艾尼斯风神的比赛后，\n她似乎也找到了自己前进的方向。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7c034af543d89b7e17dd3dfa915e72ca0eca33cc78606f09b6baeb2411ef07e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
