    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b16b099a4f5c34ea06dce88",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不仅是目白赖恩而已。\n艾尼斯风神的跑姿总是能激励人心。\n带给众多人们活力与鼓励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e99e80eb7bb03a95fe57df29fbf93a0a10d49a2a9944648b5c8b7ea0ad79abf6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
