      "uid": "zhcn:c4884883d7f3799b79f79e86",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "再来的“皋月赏”，一定会有更多支持她的人吧。\n她的努力……\n和取得胜利的模样深受众人的期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c034225f5e991fa2dab497907388e8fcc27464f74fd9105481a46596ef63a6b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
