      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "养好伤后艾尼斯风神向我提出\n“想要学习比赛后\n不会不支倒地的跑法”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37748655ef7f112797048b989bef49d9948ee5e2510d384ebde05c4c8a8d1c96",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
