    {
      "uid": "zhcn:201cbee423073edbf547b0e5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了跑赢“菊花赏”，\n我们想在今年夏天学会高效率跑法。\n我打算尽可能地尝试各种方法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "349e26f14c220b7392b78c49477271760589f343853a97d5f0abf879d60acaab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
