    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42012da6e3a1cde6aa868f4b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与此同时，\n艾尼斯风神利用闲暇的时间做起手工。\n她似乎还增加了打工时数……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ae4d8bea993b68e9371f87e5ec4832a95fbc0b5c1fe369b8558e035ed4021bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
