    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0385a2f2827920694761394",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她对学习高效率跑法依旧兴致高昂，\n也充满干劲准备迎接集训。\n我要帮她规划一个充实的夏季集训！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0da50d7505e901101ca6c387ce698c8c3851bc3103b965f93c4311af813d743f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
