      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训开始。\n赛马娘都各自朝自己的目标迈进之时，\n目白赖恩则得为了脚伤放弃“天皇赏（秋）”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "47d1745949fb707847725e307a8e08d5c15c0a4404b14500cf963d501439aaee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
