    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7381fad8c35deb2320970c6e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因此她似乎打算在夏季集训中\n全力辅佐目白麦昆进行训练。\n……也算是将遗憾寄托在目白麦昆身上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9ce19f2b923d3c79863eb8a5e9a8453d0fde5afc22df0313806b6077ede0b74",
