    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f49b51ef2d446cb5d6b546c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "艾尼斯风神展现了毅力及不服输的模样。\n毕竟她也背负了许多人对自己的期望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba10bdf98ddfded7f9ad6aff15f583b3f8c317a184b77061836ab820d9002cc8",
