    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b328042db121e44743c1644c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了让艾尼斯风神能更加\n热衷于最喜爱的跑步，\n我要帮她规划一个充实的夏季集训！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f8a4fe075c88dee7a4228a84ff8bfd3882d016a50cf00c5c7a425ce0372b7de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
