    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb34939da7237bdf359e1035",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战当天。\n艾尼斯风神的双胞胎妹妹来到现场为她加油。\n从姐妹间的互动可以看出她是个称职的姐姐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37924977da8ea556b8d003b8f4b608891dad1ec3eb7966de2c6c27b10d3aff36",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031407.json",
      "json_path": [
