      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“朝日杯FS”是艾尼斯风神第一次挑战GⅠ竞赛。\n眼看比赛就要开始，\n准备时间不够充分一事还是令人感到不安。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7178b97a62e73f84c3e510e2eeb8dec74ef3f0dda36881701a034af46760c8a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
