      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "艾尼斯风神发现了我的不安，\n便前来鼓励我、安抚我的情绪。\n现在就专心相信她的实力吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33ff2b849f5a34bff656c1d3d3273c57846cecf05094c3cb3c99dc06d2b4c24f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
