      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "加上努力学跳舞的\n双胞胎妹妹们也为她加油。\n艾尼斯风神自然而然地充满了干劲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e676513cf281c221d27c4a1f3f499c70523e658dbfe0dcf354c4928106b0448",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
