      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "到了“皋月赏”当天。\n比以往更受关注的艾尼斯风神\n也将成为更多对手的挑战目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3deb75afe259d201b8e2a46a903ade2e3425e55cf131cc900e067951b0d913f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
