    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a6a459e1726f892418afd6a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当中包含了好友目白赖恩。\n双方对彼此都燃起了竞争心。\n激烈又精彩的“皋月赏”即将开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "556f28d70f29b50b24554112d95cee942569c0bd186946e24611e76eb8d7d52b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031409.json",
