    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:830ce1b29d9925a810730d17",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "艾尼斯风神在接受采访时，\n充满自信地表示\n“自己要以最高支持度赢得日本德比”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc89abf50c12bb35efe77d98c969d6990b291dcfb0731a1ef8b8c25dad51ad9f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ee9d66a98098c948de09c3c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是和训练员两人三脚地努力追逐的梦想。\n彼此间深厚的信任让她眼神坚定不疑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "928012881bee4811e2e7a9f0222065a4634f4434101e28d62e730e85d8205b76",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e31a623c863c678de814ab28",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与此同时，这一路上\n受到艾尼斯风神活跃表现刺激的目白赖恩。\n对她说“我在你的身上找到了自己的梦想”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d57ba7158fa92318d8519edc49b3de57f77ee251d6f205dbf1c62af25d4bc1dd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ea6209f2dbd959da4178d12",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而艾尼斯风神也有无法退让的梦想。\n因为这场“日本德比”，\n妹妹们也在现场为她加油！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0cece4c35e529b9b22751eb34b9b1959b0db77084f5e770c9cbc056e20a179d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
